      "zotero_refs": "[8GL7ZT7Y]: 25, translated from [8GL7ZT7Y]: 14b7 (zul phur bshad pa'i grwa btsugs).\r\n[W4T5ZMUP]: 39-40. Founder of a bshad grwa at Zul phu in the 1130s, close to 'O ljang mdo (ID:6710). Ordained Phag mo gru pa (ID:3856) in 1134.\r\n[R894SIKE]: 655 (dgung lo nyi shu rtsa lnga la zul phur bya 'dul gyis mkhan po | rgya dmar gyis slob dpon | ar gyis gsang ston mdzad nas bsnyen par rdzogs |). Full ordination of Phag mo gru pa (ID:3856) at Zul phu when he was 25.\r\n[CJPTU9FV]: 34. Bya 'dul acted as \"mkhan po\" in Phag mo gru pa (ID:3856)'s full ordination in Zul phu in 1134.\r\n[R894SIKE]: 109 (bya 'dul 'dzin ... de rjes zul phur bshad grwa btsugs |). Founded a monastic college in Zul phu.\r\n[R894SIKE]: 109 (bya 'dul 'dzin ... dgung lo bdun cu rtsa drug pa zul phu'i gzims khang du sku gshegs |). Died in Zul phu at the age of 76.",
