  "comments": "Founded as a Vinaya seminar. Located in present-day Tshad-sna xiang of Chu shur rdzong, on the southern bank of the sKyid chu river ([W4T5ZMUP]: 38).\r\nHad close teaching bonds with gNas rnying (ID:4341) through Rin chen dpal bzang po (ID:6714).\r\nDonated to the Karmapa in 1545.\r\nRenovated and reconverted into a dGe lugs site in ca. 1639 by dKon mchog chos 'phel (ID:6328). Went into decay in the late 17th c. (See [W4T5ZMUP]: 38-39).",
